🍋 The Perfect Lemon Sorbet (Ultra Smooth, Bright, and Scoopable)

This is not your average lemon sorbet. This is a precision-balanced, ultra-smooth, professional-level sorbet with bold citrus punch, clean sweetness, and perfect scoopability straight from the freezer.

We’re using a combination of sugars, stabilizers, and fresh lemon to create a texture that’s silky—not icy, and a flavor that hits sharp, sweet, and refreshing all at once.

---

 Ingredients
 • Erythritol (43.6 g) → ~¼ cup
 • Sugar (436.1 g) → ~2 ⅛ cups
 • Lemon juice (74.9 g) → ~⅓ cup
 • Lemon zest (20 g) → ~3 tbsp
 • Water (1098.5 g) → ~4 ⅔ cups
 • Karo light corn syrup (71.3 g) → ~3 tbsp
 • Xanthan gum (5.7 g) → ~1 ¾ tsp
 • Citric acid (1.5–2 g) → ~¼–½ tsp

---

