---

Pro Tips
- Always use fresh lemons—this recipe depends on real citrus oils  
- Whisk thoroughly to fully dissolve and hydrate the xanthan  
- Rest the base completely before churning for best texture and flavour

---

🧊 Result
A restaurant-quality lemon sorbet that’s bright, smooth, and intensely refreshing—with zero compromise on texture.

